<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>HolidayPirates</title><link>https://www.holidaypirates.com</link><description>HolidayPirates: Cheap holidays and last-minute deals for 2026</description><lastBuildDate>Wed, 04 Nov 2026 21:45:47 +0000</lastBuildDate><docs>https://www.rssboard.org/rss-specification</docs><generator>HolidayPirates Feed</generator><language>en</language><category>Travel</category><atom:link xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" href="https://www.holidaypirates.com/feed" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"></atom:link><image><link>https://www.holidaypirates.com</link><title>HolidayPirates</title><url>https://www.holidaypirates.com/hp-app/icons/favicon-96x96.png</url><description>HolidayPirates: Cheap holidays and last-minute deals for 2026</description><height>96</height><width>96</width></image><item><title>ULTRA all-inclusive luxury Turkey holiday 🌴☀️🍹</title><link>https://www.holidaypirates.com/packages/nova-life-hotel-alanya-antalya-turkey</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.holidaypirates.com/packages/nova-life-hotel-alanya-antalya-turkey</guid><pubDate>Wed, 04 Nov 2026 16:09:41 +0000</pubDate><description>Mateys, if you're going to go to Turkey, you might as well stay in the brand-new 5⭐️ Nova Life Hotel located in Alanya.Having just opened its doors, everything here is sparkling new. There is a choice fo swimming pools, a spa and wellness centre, and a private beach with free sun loungers, parasols, and a beach bar. 🏖️You will stay on an ultra all-inclusive basis, so food and drinks is available around the clock. There is a 24-hour lobby bar for late-night cocktail cravings, a dedicated "Food Street" for casual day snacking, a patisserie, and three distinct à la carte restaurants (Turkish, Italian, and Chinese). 🍕🍹</description><enclosure url="https://image.urlaubspiraten.de/640/image/upload/v1781775345/Impressions%20and%20Other%20Assets/2_sa4m6f.jpg" length="80451" type="image/jpeg"></enclosure></item><item><title>4⭐ Malta break in NEW hotel with heated rooftop infinity pool &amp; sky bar 💦🇲🇹</title><link>https://www.holidaypirates.com/packages/innside-by-melia-bugibba-malta</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.holidaypirates.com/packages/innside-by-melia-bugibba-malta</guid><pubDate>Wed, 04 Nov 2026 16:05:28 +0000</pubDate><description>The INNSiDE by Melia Bugibba does things properly: a heated rooftop infinity pool that keeps going whatever the season, and a sky bar perched right above it for when you fancy a cocktail with your view.This deal bundles flights with your stay at the 4-star hotel, so the only real decision left is whether to swim first or drink first.Price breakdown👇Resort fees are paid directly to the hotel when you arrive, not to On the Beach. We’re honest pirates, so we like to be upfront about exactly what your holiday will cost.</description><enclosure url="https://image.urlaubspiraten.de/640/image/upload/v1793790687/Impressions%20and%20Other%20Assets/12_fnilb3.jpg" length="37152" type="image/jpeg"></enclosure></item><item><title>Kefalonia beach getaway with a suite &amp; private pool 😍💦 Up to 54% OFF 🔥</title><link>https://www.holidaypirates.com/packages/celestial-all-suites-kefalonia-greece</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.holidaypirates.com/packages/celestial-all-suites-kefalonia-greece</guid><pubDate>Wed, 04 Nov 2026 15:38:19 +0000</pubDate><description>We've found the stunning 4-star boutique hotel Celestial All Suites for LESS THAN HALF PRICE with Secret Escapes. 🔥 Thanks to them discounting this trip by up to 54%, you'll get five nights in their junior suite with a private pool and forest views from £599.50 each when travelling as a couple. You'll fly direct from London in May for this price. You'll also get daily breakfast, a welcome drink, and a 15% discount on spa treatments included. This trip is fully customisable to suit your needs: you can depart from another airport, depart on a different day, change the duration of the trip, the number of guests, plus upgrade your basis or room type for a supplement. Click to find out more. 🔥</description><enclosure url="https://image.urlaubspiraten.de/640/image/upload/v1752567831/Impressions%20and%20Other%20Assets/72b66583_2a38_4f22_8197_3d947b3f4628_ymyqnb.avif" length="41791" type="image/jpeg"></enclosure></item><item><title>Peak-season Cambodia: 12-night 4⭐ Phnom Penh holiday with rooftop pool 💦🇰🇭</title><link>https://www.holidaypirates.com/packages/the-skye-phnom-penh-hotel-apartments-phnom-penh-cambodia</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.holidaypirates.com/packages/the-skye-phnom-penh-hotel-apartments-phnom-penh-cambodia</guid><pubDate>Wed, 04 Nov 2026 15:12:32 +0000</pubDate><description>Twelve nights at The Skye Phnom Penh Hotel &amp; Apartments gives you proper time to settle into Cambodia's capital, not just skim the surface of it.This 4-star apartment hotel comes with its own rooftop pool, so after a day weaving through markets and riverside temples, you can cool off with the city laid out below you.Throw in the fact that January and February are widely considered the best months to visit -- dry, warm and far less sticky than the summer months -- and the timing works just as well as the setup.From £799 per person, that is a lot of holiday for the money, especially considering flights, luggage and breakfast are all included.</description><enclosure url="https://image.urlaubspiraten.de/640/image/upload/v1793804882/Impressions%20and%20Other%20Assets/x5pc7bfodge1nyq4wmdz.jpg" length="44638" type="image/jpeg"></enclosure></item><item><title>2-night dreamy escape to the prettiest village in Italy 🇮🇹🥹</title><link>https://www.holidaypirates.com/packages/hotel-eden-valeggio-sul-mincio-italy</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.holidaypirates.com/packages/hotel-eden-valeggio-sul-mincio-italy</guid><pubDate>Wed, 04 Nov 2026 15:11:48 +0000</pubDate><description>Pirates, I think we've just spotted a 2-night mini-break to one of the prettiest villages in Italy, and it won't break the bank 🇮🇹You'll fly direct from London to Verona and set up base at Hotel Eden in Valeggio sul Mincio, around a 30–40 minute drive away. It's the perfect base for exploring the beautiful Lake Garda, which is right on your doorstep.Not only is the scenery breathtaking, but Valeggio itself is famous for its tortellini, so come hungry! 🍝Think lakeside strolls, proper Italian coffee and a slower pace of life that'll have you wishing you could stay longer! ☕Price breakdown👇</description><enclosure url="https://image.urlaubspiraten.de/640/image/upload/v1650965230/Impressions%20and%20Other%20Assets/shutterstock_1099020890_okqbc8.jpg" length="59662" type="image/jpeg"></enclosure></item><item><title>4🌟 Malta family holiday at a premium spa resort with flights &amp; brekkie 🇲🇹 🌅 </title><link>https://www.holidaypirates.com/packages/ramla-bay-resort-malta</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.holidaypirates.com/packages/ramla-bay-resort-malta</guid><pubDate>Wed, 04 Nov 2026 15:08:49 +0000</pubDate><description>Pirates, we've found this banging winter deal from Thomas Cook, where you can spend 7 nights at the well-rated 4-star Ramla Bay Resort with the family from £164 each.🔥For this price, you'll travel in December for some winter sun with your other half and two kids: you'll still have lovely weather, just without the summer crowds, with daily high temperatures around 18–21°C. ☀️ That sure beats the temperature in the UK! The seafront hotel has panoramic sea views, its own private stretch of rocky and sandy shoreline, a luxe spa, and outdoor saltwater pools. It's also located near Majjistral Nature Park, so there's plenty to explore, or you can hop on a short boat trip directly to the famous Blue Lagoon. You can go with one kid from £170 each or go as a couple from £215pp (plus any resort fees paid directly to the hotel). </description><enclosure url="https://image.urlaubspiraten.de/640/image/upload/v1623231987/Impressions%20and%20Other%20Assets/Malta.jpg" length="89787" type="image/jpeg"></enclosure></item><item><title>4⭐ all-inclusive Lanzarote break with waterpark 💦🇪🇸</title><link>https://www.holidaypirates.com/packages/hl-paradise-island-aparthotel-waterpark-lanzarote</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.holidaypirates.com/packages/hl-paradise-island-aparthotel-waterpark-lanzarote</guid><pubDate>Wed, 04 Nov 2026 14:50:59 +0000</pubDate><description>Fancy swapping grey skies for guaranteed winter sun with barely any notice?This last-minute five-night stay at the 4⭐ HL Paradise Island Aparthotel &amp; Waterpark in Lanzarote ticks every box.The waterpark means there's no excuse for sitting still, and with all-inclusive sorted, you won't be reaching for your wallet every time you fancy a drink by the pool.All that's left to pack is your sunglasses.</description><enclosure url="https://image.urlaubspiraten.de/640/image/upload/v1732709775/Impressions%20and%20Other%20Assets/hl-paradise-island-aparthotel-and-waterpark-0_ukfsyh.jpg" length="50070" type="image/jpeg"></enclosure></item><item><title>Last-min half-board Benidorm week near Old Town 🌞🇪🇸</title><link>https://www.holidaypirates.com/packages/poseidon-playa-benidorm</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.holidaypirates.com/packages/poseidon-playa-benidorm</guid><pubDate>Wed, 04 Nov 2026 14:27:02 +0000</pubDate><description>Picture this: mornings on your own terrace, coffee in hand, with the Mediterranean stretching out in front of you before you've even left your room.That's the daily backdrop at Poseidon Playa, a 60-metre sandy-footed walk from Poniente Beach.This 3-star hotel suits couples and families nicely; half-board means dinner's sorted, and both the old town of Benidorm and Parque de Elche are within easy reach for an evening wander.With flights from Liverpool included and the trip leaving in just over five weeks, this seven-night stay is £320 each when travelling as a pair. This deal is fully customisable: you can change the duration, departure date, departure airport, number of guests and more, if you're willing to pay a bit more. </description><enclosure url="https://image.urlaubspiraten.de/640/image/upload/v1793794825/Impressions%20and%20Other%20Assets/Screenshot_2026-11-04_at_13.08.33_vdnfdx.png" length="287624" type="image/jpeg"></enclosure></item><item><title>Romantic 2-night trip to Tuscany in unspoilt nature 😍🇮🇹💞</title><link>https://www.holidaypirates.com/packages/villa-ermellina-siena-a-tribute-portfolio-hotel-tuscany-italy</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.holidaypirates.com/packages/villa-ermellina-siena-a-tribute-portfolio-hotel-tuscany-italy</guid><pubDate>Wed, 04 Nov 2026 14:22:37 +0000</pubDate><description>Italy is ALWAYS a good idea. You might not think of visiting in December, but we think it's the perfect winter mini-break. Imagine going wine tasting, a delicious Chianti red wine in hand, a fire blazing, while you're overlooking Tuscany's rolling hills.Well, from £191, that can be a reality. For this price, you'll get return flights from London to Pisa and 2 nights at the lush 4-star Villa Ermellina Siena, a Tribute Portfolio Hotel. You'll also get breakfast, car hire, and a wine tasting included. The hotel has a beautiful park, a Turkish bath, padel courts, and it has a beautiful view of the Siena skyline - perfect for watching the sun go down over the city. You can take this 2-night trip without the car hire and wine tasting from £153, but we think it's worth paying the extra £38. You can fully customise this deal: change the departure airport, duration, room type, departure date (between November 2026 and June 2027), number of guests etc. to match your needs, as long as you're happy to pay more. </description><enclosure url="https://image.urlaubspiraten.de/640/image/upload/v1603284278/mediavault_images/lu64jttoijulf1j7bqms.jpg" length="33047" type="image/jpeg"></enclosure></item><item><title>All-inclusive family holiday to 4🌟 beachfront hotel in Tunisia 😍☀️  </title><link>https://www.holidaypirates.com/packages/el-mouradi-port-el-kantaoui-tunisia</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.holidaypirates.com/packages/el-mouradi-port-el-kantaoui-tunisia</guid><pubDate>Wed, 04 Nov 2026 13:19:59 +0000</pubDate><description>Mateys, check out this awesome beachfront holiday at the 4⭐️ El Mouradi Port El Kantaoui in Tunisia in December from £160 each when travelling with your significant other and kiddo. This deal includes return flights and all-inclusive, and is perfect for those seeking a bit of winter sun. 🌞 The resort has multiple pools, some overlooking the sea, a 36-hole golf course, and a dedicated kids' club. This deal is from Thomas Cook — yes, that Thomas Cook — but the company's name was purchased and is now part of the eSky Group. Thomas Cook holidays are ATOL &amp; ABTA protected, offering flexible options and you can pay for your holiday in instalments.This deal is completely customisable - you can change the departure airport, number of guests, duration, departure date (from November 2026 – October 2027), and more to match your preference. </description><enclosure url="https://image.urlaubspiraten.de/640/image/upload/v1789130408/Impressions%20and%20Other%20Assets/ad294823_z_rq7ejb.jpg" length="53861" type="image/jpeg"></enclosure></item><item><title>Thailand: Phuket week with direct flights ✈️🇹🇭</title><link>https://www.holidaypirates.com/packages/hotel-quip-bed-breakfast-phuket-town</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.holidaypirates.com/packages/hotel-quip-bed-breakfast-phuket-town</guid><pubDate>Wed, 04 Nov 2026 12:52:31 +0000</pubDate><description>Forget the usual long-haul slog of connections and layover lounges -- this trip to Phuket gets you there via direct flights, so more of your seven nights are spent exploring rather than waiting at a gate.Hotel Quip puts you right in the thick of the old town's Sino-Portuguese shophouses, street food stalls and laid-back cafes, with bed and breakfast sorted each morning before you head out.It is the kind of base that suits wandering more than lounging, and with direct flights bookending the week, the travelling bit barely gets a look-in.Price breakdown👇</description><enclosure url="https://image.urlaubspiraten.de/640/image/upload/v1728469396/mediavault_images/shutterstock_2337247643_nx5tmr.jpg" length="46818" type="image/jpeg"></enclosure></item><item><title>5⭐ all-inclusive Sri Lanka holiday with rooftop bar &amp; flights 💦🇱🇰</title><link>https://www.holidaypirates.com/packages/the-eden-beruwala-sri-lanka</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.holidaypirates.com/packages/the-eden-beruwala-sri-lanka</guid><pubDate>Wed, 04 Nov 2026 12:46:06 +0000</pubDate><description>Sri Lanka pairs lush scenery with laid-back beach life, and this seven-night all-inclusive stay at 5⭐️ The Eden Beruwala is a brilliant way to see why.Spend your days drifting between the pool and the beach, book yourself in for a spa treatment, then watch the sunset from the rooftop bar with a cocktail that tastes better for the view.Etihad flights and 25kg luggage are included, so all that's really left to plan is which lounger you'll claim first.</description><enclosure url="https://image.urlaubspiraten.de/640/image/upload/v1793796028/Impressions%20and%20Other%20Assets/2_vlmslq.jpg" length="59733" type="image/jpeg"></enclosure></item><item><title>Stay in a private desert casita where High School Musical 2 was filmed 🏜️ 🌄</title><link>https://www.holidaypirates.com/hotels/inn-at-entrada-st-george-utah-hotel-deal</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.holidaypirates.com/hotels/inn-at-entrada-st-george-utah-hotel-deal</guid><pubDate>Wed, 04 Nov 2026 12:09:17 +0000</pubDate><description>Pirates, we’re always on the lookout for hotels that offer a little something extra, and this one definitely caught our attention. The Inn at Entrada sits among southern Utah’s red rock landscapes and offers private casitas, incredible views, and easy access to Snow Canyon State Park, one of the region’s most underrated spots.The property also features a resort pool, spa, fitness center, pickleball and tennis courts, plus a championship golf course. But honestly, it’s the location that steals the show.🏴‍☠️ Pirate Insight: If the resort looks familiar, there’s a reason. High School Musical 2 filmed its Lava Springs Country Club scenes here, and it still looks remarkably similar today. While everyone heads to Zion, Snow Canyon is just a few miles away and offers a lot of the same red rock scenery with a fraction of the crowds.</description><enclosure url="https://image.urlaubspiraten.de/640/image/upload/v1781595741/Impressions%20and%20Other%20Assets/entrada-country-club_o0f60b.jpg" length="55910" type="image/jpeg"></enclosure></item><item><title>ALL-INCLUSIVE family week at 4⭐️ beachfront Kos hotel 😍🇬🇷🧑‍🧑‍🧒‍🧒</title><link>https://www.holidaypirates.com/packages/kipriotis-village-resort-by-anayia-all-inclusive-resorts-kos-greece-family</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.holidaypirates.com/packages/kipriotis-village-resort-by-anayia-all-inclusive-resorts-kos-greece-family</guid><pubDate>Wed, 04 Nov 2026 11:45:38 +0000</pubDate><description>Pirates, we've just spotted an all-inclusive Kos, Greece deal for you and your family from Thomas Cook that'll get you starting the 2027 European summer season off with a BANG from £375 each.🔥That'll get you 7 nights in May 2027 at the 4-star Kipriotis Village Resort by Anayia All Inclusive Resorts, with flights and all your meals and drinks included. The hotel has beachfront access, FIVE swimming pools (including one with a pirate ship and waterslides), multiple themed restaurants, AND easy cycle paths direct to Kos Town, making it the perfect family-friendly escape to the sea. This price is based on two adults and one kid sharing. If you have two children, it'll cost you from £430 per person (£1,720 total). If you'd prefer to travel on a different date, there are still many other dates with great prices available. You can also go as a couple from £455 each (£910 total).This deal is completely customisable, so you can change the number of guests, duration, departure date, and departure airport.</description><enclosure url="https://image.urlaubspiraten.de/640/image/upload/v1739269142/Impressions%20and%20Other%20Assets/kos_shutterstock_616766564_wu4dty.jpg" length="50369" type="image/jpeg"></enclosure></item><item><title>All-inclusive break to 4🌟 DoubleTree by Hilton resort in El Gouna, Egypt 😍🇪🇬</title><link>https://www.holidaypirates.com/packages/doubletree-by-hilton-mangroovy-el-gouna-resort-el-gouna-red-sea-egypt</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.holidaypirates.com/packages/doubletree-by-hilton-mangroovy-el-gouna-resort-el-gouna-red-sea-egypt</guid><pubDate>Wed, 04 Nov 2026 11:27:01 +0000</pubDate><description>We've found a week of all-inclusive bliss in El Gouna, a resort on Egypt’s Red Sea, near Hurghada, on Secret Escapes, which SAVES YOU UP TO 67%! It's now a great price: from £693, you'll get your return flights and 7 nights at the brand-new DoubleTree by Hilton Mangroovy El Gouna Resort, which has its own private beach. 🏖️You'll travel in early December 2026 for this price, which is perfect for some winter sun in the post-Christmas slump, but there are lots of other departure dates to choose from. You can extend your trip for a great price too. You can also travel from other departure airports like Manchester and Bristol for a supplement. See below for more info. 👇</description><enclosure url="https://image.urlaubspiraten.de/640/image/upload/v1762179549/Impressions%20and%20Other%20Assets/aa49f552_871a_4ca4_ba8e_191cfccaa3ee_euqlwh.avif" length="48544" type="image/jpeg"></enclosure></item><item><title>Extreme date night in Prague 🇨🇿🎄😍</title><link>https://www.holidaypirates.com/packages/gregory-house-prague</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.holidaypirates.com/packages/gregory-house-prague</guid><pubDate>Wed, 04 Nov 2026 11:16:00 +0000</pubDate><description>Fancy a proper date night for less than what a night out in London may cost you... 🇨🇿 A quick hop to Prague gets you one night at the Serviced Apartment Gregory House, a short stroll from the main station, right as the Náměstí Míru Christmas market lights up from 20 November -- early enough to beat the crowds.I mean... I've spent more on a single night out in London than the price of this trip, and the rumour is if you go to the right places you can get a pint here for under £1.50 😱With flights and the stay both sorted, all that's left is deciding where to eat. Price breakdown👇</description><enclosure url="https://image.urlaubspiraten.de/640/image/upload/v1791894201/mediavault_images/shutterstock_2666265991_nvlvcs.jpg" length="71732" type="image/jpeg"></enclosure></item><item><title>STUNNING 5-star Montenegro holiday: this hotel is exceptionally rated 🤫</title><link>https://www.holidaypirates.com/packages/stunning-5-star-montenegro-holiday-this-hotel-is-exceptionally-rated</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.holidaypirates.com/packages/stunning-5-star-montenegro-holiday-this-hotel-is-exceptionally-rated</guid><pubDate>Wed, 04 Nov 2026 10:10:51 +0000</pubDate><description>Montenegro is one of the hottest destinations for 2026, so you're going to want to visit before it becomes too popular and prices start to skyrocket. We've found an awesome luxury deal for you from £310, including flights, breakfast, and two free spa treatments. Similar last-minute dates for this trip can reach over DOUBLE this price, so you can save £100s with this great find. You'll be staying for five nights at the 5-star Lazure Hotel &amp; Marina based right on the Bay of Kotor. This deal scores 9.6/10 on Voyage Privé, and the hotel is rated 4.8/5 on Tripadvisor and 10/10 on Expedia. So if we can't convince you, we're sure the reviews will. For this price, you'll depart from London in November. You can change departure airports, duration, dates, number of guests, etc. for a supplement. You can travel in April 2027 from under £500 on many dates. </description><enclosure url="https://image.urlaubspiraten.de/640/image/upload/v1721219205/Impressions%20and%20Other%20Assets/855061_iey0ul.jpg" length="46401" type="image/jpeg"></enclosure></item><item><title>Tenerife Airbnb stay with heated pool and flights 💦📍Canary Islands</title><link>https://www.holidaypirates.com/packages/the-albatros-golf-del-sur-canary-islands</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.holidaypirates.com/packages/the-albatros-golf-del-sur-canary-islands</guid><pubDate>Wed, 04 Nov 2026 10:09:50 +0000</pubDate><description>Forget cramped hotel rooms with nowhere to spread out -- this apartment in Golf del Sur gives your group actual breathing space, sleeping four in comfort with flights already sorted.The heated pool means swimming season never really ends here, whatever the weather's doing back home.With a rating of 4.83/5 from 59 reviews, it's clearly doing something right.Price breakdown based on 4 sharing👇Or, stay as a couple from £262 per person❗️</description><enclosure url="https://image.urlaubspiraten.de/640/image/upload/v1793786557/Impressions%20and%20Other%20Assets/1_nz3gp9.jpg" length="67781" type="image/jpeg"></enclosure></item><item><title>Bangkok: 18-night adventure with direct flights 🇹🇭</title><link>https://www.holidaypirates.com/packages/resort-shanti-lodge-bangkok</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.holidaypirates.com/packages/resort-shanti-lodge-bangkok</guid><pubDate>Wed, 04 Nov 2026 09:59:35 +0000</pubDate><description>Eighteen nights in Bangkok -- a rare stretch of time that turns a holiday into something closer to a proper reset.Direct flights from London and your stay at Resort Shanti Lodge are both sorted, leaving you free to figure out the rest as you go: a slow float down the Chao Phraya, an evening at a buzzing night market, a day doing absolutely nothing at all.Thailand's capital rewards travellers who linger, and this is about as much time as you could ask for to do exactly that.Price breakdown👇</description><enclosure url="https://image.urlaubspiraten.de/640/image/upload/v1628687424/mediavault_images/shutterstock_725797633_e6wz1q.jpg" length="66861" type="image/jpeg"></enclosure></item><item><title>Bucharest mini-break with Dracula's castle tour 🧛 </title><link>https://www.holidaypirates.com/packages/hotel-michelangelo-bucharest-romania-including-draculas-castle-tour</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.holidaypirates.com/packages/hotel-michelangelo-bucharest-romania-including-draculas-castle-tour</guid><pubDate>Wed, 04 Nov 2026 09:58:18 +0000</pubDate><description>Mateys, if you love a city break but you're tired of the same old trips to European hot spots, why not try something new? Ever thought about visiting Romania? We've found a 2-night break to Bucharest, where you'll stay at the cosy Hotel Michelangelo, from £99. This price is discounted by up to 37% AND includes flights, too. For this price, you may as well see what the city has to offer and tick another country off your list! 🌍✈️The best thing about this deal? It includes a full-day tour of Dracula's castle (including Bran Castle and Peles Castle), which still leaves you with time to explore the Old Town. We'd recommend cruising down the River Dâmbovita.This offer is over on Wowcher and there are quite a few dates in February for this price, but there are many dates in 2026 left (including Christmas market season, from £109) and 2027 if you don't mind spending a bit more money. </description><enclosure url="https://image.urlaubspiraten.de/640/image/upload/v1741212883/Impressions%20and%20Other%20Assets/shutterstock_729630979_nnvnkk.jpg" length="67654" type="image/jpeg"></enclosure></item><item><title>Last-minute Barcelona mini-break with flights ✈️🇪🇸</title><link>https://www.holidaypirates.com/packages/hotel-glories-barcelona</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.holidaypirates.com/packages/hotel-glories-barcelona</guid><pubDate>Wed, 04 Nov 2026 09:35:36 +0000</pubDate><description>Here's a bold claim: you don't need a week to fall for Barcelona, just one night.This last-minute mini break pairs flights from London with a stay at Hotel Glòries, giving you enough time for tapas, a wander past Gaudi's wildest architecture, and a proper sangria before bed.No long countdown, no overthinking it -- just book and go.Sometimes the shortest trips leave the biggest impression.Price breakdown👇</description><enclosure url="https://image.urlaubspiraten.de/640/image/upload/v1638188253/Global%20Brand%20Assets/FREEONES/logan-armstrong-hVhfqhDYciU-unsplash_wyi9s6.jpg" length="102172" type="image/jpeg"></enclosure></item><item><title>Zürich family break with Glacier Express option 🚂🇨🇭</title><link>https://www.holidaypirates.com/packages/inside-five-zurich-serviced-apartment-zurich-switzerland</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.holidaypirates.com/packages/inside-five-zurich-serviced-apartment-zurich-switzerland</guid><pubDate>Wed, 04 Nov 2026 09:12:43 +0000</pubDate><description>Inside Five Zürich serves up serviced apartments rather than cramped hotel rooms -- a proper win when you are travelling with a five-year-old and a pile of extra bags.Three nights gives you room to actually unpack, cook a lazy breakfast and let the little one run around without knocking over the minibar.Fancy a day trip?Add the optional Glacier Express for a ride through some genuinely jaw-dropping Alpine scenery. If you book direct through the official website, kids under six travel for free.Flights from London are included, so all that is left to do is pack the snow boots and go.Price breakdown for 3 sharing👇</description><enclosure url="https://image.urlaubspiraten.de/640/image/upload/v1607332280/mediavault_images/shutterstock_535685914_tqc4sb.jpg" length="69298" type="image/jpeg"></enclosure></item><item><title>🗽 Long weekend in NYC with DIRECT flights &amp; 4⭐️ Times Square hotel</title><link>https://www.holidaypirates.com/packages/long-weekend-nyc-times-square-row-nyc-new-york</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.holidaypirates.com/packages/long-weekend-nyc-times-square-row-nyc-new-york</guid><pubDate>Wed, 04 Nov 2026 09:10:15 +0000</pubDate><description>We’ve hunted down an absolute steal for January: 3 nights at the 4-star Row NYC (fully revamped since May this year), plus direct flights from Dublin or London, starting from just £479 per person!Why you'll love this trip:📍 Unbeatable Location: Stay steps from Broadway in a freshly renovated 4-star hotel near Times Square.❄️ Off-Peak Perks: Enjoy NYC's museums, shopping, and cosy coffee spots with half the usual tourist crowds.✈️ Direct flights so you waste zero time on layovers.Multiple January weekend dates are available. ☕🛍️🎭Price breakdown👇</description><enclosure url="https://image.urlaubspiraten.de/640/image/upload/v1603283326/mediavault_images/kjsyfoqqam78c1o0boki.jpg" length="128683" type="image/jpeg"></enclosure></item><item><title>Extreme date night 💕 4⭐ Dublin Valentine's mini-break with flights 😍🥂</title><link>https://www.holidaypirates.com/packages/hotel-the-fleet-dublin</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.holidaypirates.com/packages/hotel-the-fleet-dublin</guid><pubDate>Wed, 04 Nov 2026 08:54:48 +0000</pubDate><description>One night officially booked, but thanks to an early flight out and a late one back, this Dublin getaway plays out more like two full days in the city.Hotel The Fleet puts you right in the thick of it -- cobbled streets, live music spilling out of pubs, and a decent pint never more than a few steps away.With Valentine's Day on the calendar, it is the kind of low-effort, high-reward trip that makes a short break feel generous.Price breakdown👇</description><enclosure url="https://image.urlaubspiraten.de/640/image/upload/v1603291721/mediavault_images/f8cm4crviaqsnycyldn4.jpg" length="61369" type="image/jpeg"></enclosure></item><item><title>WOW! This 4⭐️ Cotswolds hotel looks like something out of a fairytale</title><link>https://www.holidaypirates.com/hotels/hotel-de-vere-tortworth-court-cotswolds</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.holidaypirates.com/hotels/hotel-de-vere-tortworth-court-cotswolds</guid><pubDate>Wed, 04 Nov 2026 08:24:10 +0000</pubDate><description>Check out the 4-star Hotel De Vere Tortworth Court in Wotton-under-Edge on the edge of the Cotswolds.This 19th-century mansion is set within a 30-acre estate, complete with its own historic arboretum housing over 300 species of rare and protected trees. The hotel's ultimate architectural showstopper is The Atrium restaurant, which boasts a spectacular, soaring 60-foot-high glass roof.It’s a fantastic option if you want to travel with a dog, as the hotel is completely pet-friendly and properly spoils your four-legged friends. Even better, all guests get access* to the hotel’s indoor swimming pool, sauna, and jacuzzi during their stay.We’ve tracked down the best rates to help you book a getaway for less than £100 throughout the year. Prices start from just £92 per night, which works out to £46 per person! While the cheapest options are usually found on Sundays and Mondays, these incredible rates are even up for grabs during peak times, including the festive period.</description><enclosure url="https://image.urlaubspiraten.de/640/image/upload/v1780348395/Impressions%20and%20Other%20Assets/219587050_ce0rqo.jpg" length="69873" type="image/jpeg"></enclosure></item><item><title>Price drop 🚨 All-inclusive Turkey spring week for a bargain price 🔥</title><link>https://www.holidaypirates.com/packages/all-inclusive-turkey-holiday-catty-cats-garden-hotel</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.holidaypirates.com/packages/all-inclusive-turkey-holiday-catty-cats-garden-hotel</guid><pubDate>Wed, 04 Nov 2026 07:44:59 +0000</pubDate><description>Pirates, check out this package we found with On the Beach: an all-inclusive week in Turkey heading off in April from £225! Absolute bargain.You'll get direct flights and a 7-night stay at the 3⭐️ Catty Cats Garden Hotel in Side. The hotel has a 4/5 rating on Tripadvisor and has with a pool and slides.</description><enclosure url="https://image.urlaubspiraten.de/640/image/upload/v1769708432/Impressions%20and%20Other%20Assets/Catty-Cats-Garden-Hotel_j3iloy.jpg" length="64291" type="image/jpeg"></enclosure></item><item><title>4⭐ beachfront Cape Verde week with direct flights 🌞🏝️</title><link>https://www.holidaypirates.com/packages/hotel-livvo-budha-beach-sal-cape-verde</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.holidaypirates.com/packages/hotel-livvo-budha-beach-sal-cape-verde</guid><pubDate>Tue, 03 Nov 2026 17:31:05 +0000</pubDate><description>Cape Verde might not be on everyone's radar yet, but that's rather the point -- warm Atlantic breezes, year-round sunshine and none of the crowds you'd find elsewhere.This seven-night stay at the highly rated 4⭐ Hotel LIVVO Budha Beach puts you right on the sand in Santa Maria, with breakfast included each morning and direct flights taking the hassle out of getting there. Just beach, sun loungers and the sound of the sea.This was the best-value 4-star package we could find on Loveholidays.com, taking into consideration price, board and reviews. The best price departs from Bristol, but you can fly from London from £524pp.Price breakdown👇Resort fees are paid directly to the hotel when you arrive, not to Loveholidays. We’re honest pirates, so we like to be upfront about exactly what your holiday will cost.</description><enclosure url="https://image.urlaubspiraten.de/640/image/upload/v1793711345/Impressions%20and%20Other%20Assets/wdezgwe9kib10dfpwot1.jpg" length="53710" type="image/jpeg"></enclosure></item><item><title>Family 5⭐️ ultra all-inclusive Turkey holiday 🌴😎</title><link>https://www.holidaypirates.com/packages/nova-life-hotel-alanya-antalya-turkey-family</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.holidaypirates.com/packages/nova-life-hotel-alanya-antalya-turkey-family</guid><pubDate>Tue, 03 Nov 2026 17:07:00 +0000</pubDate><description>Ahoy Mateys! Treat the crew to brand-new 5⭐️ Ultra All-Inclusive luxury in Turkey! 🇹🇷✨If you're planning a family sunshine break, do it in style at the sparkling-new 5⭐️ Nova Life Hotel in Alanya. Having just opened its doors, everything across the resort is fresh, modern, and built for effortless family holidays.You'll enjoy an Ultra All-Inclusive setup, meaning round-the-clock food and drinks with zero budgeting worries. The kids will love grazing down the dedicated "Food Street" for afternoon bites, grabbing sweet treats at the on-site patisserie, or picking their favourites across Italian, Turkish, and Chinese à la carte restaurants. With multiple swimming pools, a private beach equipped with free loungers and parasols, and a luxury spa for parents, every member of the family is sorted! 🍕🍦</description><enclosure url="https://image.urlaubspiraten.de/640/image/upload/v1793811597/Impressions%20and%20Other%20Assets/1_yykpii.jpg" length="67982" type="image/jpeg"></enclosure></item><item><title>Stunning 4⭐️ Montenegro mini-break at spa hotel 🇲🇪 😍</title><link>https://www.holidaypirates.com/packages/palmon-bay-hotel-and-spa-igalo-montenegro</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.holidaypirates.com/packages/palmon-bay-hotel-and-spa-igalo-montenegro</guid><pubDate>Tue, 03 Nov 2026 16:38:32 +0000</pubDate><description>Spend four nights at the stunning 4-star Palmon Bay Hotel &amp; Spa in Montenegro with flights included. Bed and breakfast is included and each room either has a sea-view or a private balcony or terrace, and you'll get to enjoy a range of different restaurants and bar with lush views. You can enjoy an outdoor swimming pool, a spa, sports, and more. It's a beachfront hotel, so you'll be a few steps away. Price breakdown👇Resort fees are paid directly to the hotel when you arrive, not to On the Beach. We’re honest pirates, so we like to be upfront about exactly what your holiday will cost.</description><enclosure url="https://image.urlaubspiraten.de/640/image/upload/v1779459628/Impressions%20and%20Other%20Assets/Palmon-Bay-Hotel-Spa-Pool-36_lzq7bu.jpg" length="53946" type="image/jpeg"></enclosure></item><item><title>Algarve family escape for a total STEAL 🇵🇹🔥 </title><link>https://www.holidaypirates.com/packages/colina-village-carvoeiro-algarve-portugal</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.holidaypirates.com/packages/colina-village-carvoeiro-algarve-portugal</guid><pubDate>Tue, 03 Nov 2026 16:22:02 +0000</pubDate><description>Pirates, check out this absolute bargain for a family getaway! Pack up your crew and head over to the coast of Portugal's Algarve for 4 nights of early-bird sunshine from an unbelievable price. Return flights are included.You'll be staying at the highly rated Colina Village, a lovely resort tucked away in Carvoeiro. The complex features multiple swimming pools (including an indoor option if things get breezy), beautiful gardens, and excellent play areas to keep the little ones entertained. This package keeps it simple with comfortable self-catering apartment accommodation, giving your family the ultimate freedom to explore the jaw-dropping nearby beaches and caves at your own pace.Price breakdown👇Resort fees are paid directly to the hotel when you arrive, not to On the Beach. We’re honest pirates, so we like to be upfront about exactly what your holiday will cost.</description><enclosure url="https://image.urlaubspiraten.de/640/image/upload/v1740953738/mediavault_images/Albufeira_Algarve_Portugal_pyd1kw_bdxznm.jpg" length="61962" type="image/jpeg"></enclosure></item><item><title>Genoa festive break for a bargain price 🇮🇹🍷</title><link>https://www.holidaypirates.com/packages/leone-x-genova-genoa</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.holidaypirates.com/packages/leone-x-genova-genoa</guid><pubDate>Tue, 03 Nov 2026 16:11:52 +0000</pubDate><description>The Leone X Genova keeps things simple -- a comfortable 3-star base in a port city that's long been overlooked in favour of Rome or Florence, with flights already sorted so all you need to think about is what to eat first.Genoa rewards the curious: narrow alleyways open onto grand palazzi, the harbour buzzes with life, and a plate of trofie al pesto tastes better here than anywhere else in the world.Price breakdown👇Resort fees are paid directly to the hotel when you arrive, not to On the Beach. We’re honest pirates, so we like to be upfront about exactly what your holiday will cost.</description><enclosure url="https://image.urlaubspiraten.de/640/image/upload/v1628091683/mediavault_images/AdobeStock_240373384_fwlgjf.jpg" length="100115" type="image/jpeg"></enclosure></item><item><title>Lush 4⭐️ Santorini getaway in room with private pool 💦🥰</title><link>https://www.holidaypirates.com/packages/anamar-santorini-monolithos-santorini-greece</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.holidaypirates.com/packages/anamar-santorini-monolithos-santorini-greece</guid><pubDate>Tue, 03 Nov 2026 16:01:30 +0000</pubDate><description>Mateys, we have found a holiday to the Anamar Santorini in Monolithos, on the quieter eastern coast of Santorini, this spot is all about relaxation. The 4⭐️ hotel features a gorgeous outdoor pool area lined with comfy sun loungers and palm trees.You'll be just a short walk from Monolithos Beach, which is famous for its unique black sand and calm waters. The bustling capital of Fira and the airport are just a short drive away, so you can easily dive into the action whenever you fancy. You can upgrade to stay in a room with private pool.

Price breakdown👇Resort fees are paid directly to the hotel when you arrive, not to On the Beach. We’re honest pirates, so we like to be upfront about exactly what your holiday will cost.</description><enclosure url="https://image.urlaubspiraten.de/640/image/upload/v1780654671/Impressions%20and%20Other%20Assets/1_dckwc0.jpg" length="42223" type="image/jpeg"></enclosure></item><item><title>5⭐ Turkey all-inc family week during February half-term -- with waterpark 💦🇹🇷</title><link>https://www.holidaypirates.com/packages/land-of-legends-nickelodeon-hotels-resorts-antalya</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.holidaypirates.com/packages/land-of-legends-nickelodeon-hotels-resorts-antalya</guid><pubDate>Tue, 03 Nov 2026 15:51:02 +0000</pubDate><description>The Land of Legends Nickelodeon Hotels &amp; Resorts isn't just a hotel -- it's a theme park with beds attached.Think waterslides twisting past slime-green towers, pools built for cannonballing, and characters wandering the grounds for the kids to chase down.Based in Antalya, this 5-star resort hands you seven nights to let the little ones burn off energy while you actually relax for once.A family trip that sells itself before you've even packed.A family of four can travel during February half term from £559 per person // £2,236 per family.</description><enclosure url="https://image.urlaubspiraten.de/640/image/upload/v1737459905/Impressions%20and%20Other%20Assets/606137735_jlymdn.jpg" length="98697" type="image/jpeg"></enclosure></item><item><title>Last-minute winter sun week at lush 4⭐ Tenerife resort with ✈️ from MAN 💦🌴🌞  </title><link>https://www.holidaypirates.com/packages/spring-hotel-vulcano-tenerife-november</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.holidaypirates.com/packages/spring-hotel-vulcano-tenerife-november</guid><pubDate>Tue, 03 Nov 2026 15:23:10 +0000</pubDate><description>Mateys, take a look at this 7-night Tenerife getaway, including flights and a stay in a standard double room at the 4-star Spring Hotel Vulcano with breakfast (served until noon!) from £747 per person when travelling as a couple. This sustainable resort is located in the heart of the popular Playa de las Américas, a couple of minutes' walk from stunning beaches. The resort has two amazing outdoor pools, and there's a golf course, plenty of shops, and other entertainment options nearby.  This is a last-minute offer, and with the free airport transfers you get thrown in, this is by far the cheapest we can find this package online, AND you don't have to pay for it all upfront (secure the booking with a £170 total deposit). You can upgrade to a double pool view room from £928 each, which has exclusive access to the adults-only (18+) Balance area with its own infinity pool and self-service bar with drinks included (beer on tap, hello 🍻). The deal is available directly with Spring Hotels. The hotel is rated 4.3 out of 5 on Tripadvisor. There are loads of other dates available for a supplement. </description><enclosure url="https://image.urlaubspiraten.de/640/image/upload/v1793718400/Impressions%20and%20Other%20Assets/VulcanoLifestyle_40_ujmhwa.jpg" length="64122" type="image/jpeg"></enclosure></item><item><title>4⭐ Dubai break with Palm Jumeirah views &amp; a private beach 🌞🏝️🇦🇪</title><link>https://www.holidaypirates.com/packages/aloft-palm-jumeirah-dubai</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.holidaypirates.com/packages/aloft-palm-jumeirah-dubai</guid><pubDate>Tue, 03 Nov 2026 15:03:01 +0000</pubDate><description>Bargain hunters, listen up: this is seven nights in Dubai with flights included and a 4-star hotel on Palm Jumeirah -- not a bad way to make your money stretch.You’re two minutes from private beach access, with panoramic Gulf and skyline views from your own balcony and the rooftop lounge. Look out across the water and you’ll spot the iconic sail-shaped Burj Al Arab on the horizon.Days can be as lazy or as full-on as you like – think sunbathing, skyline gazing and cooling off in the pool or the warm Gulf waters.Price breakdown👇</description><enclosure url="https://image.urlaubspiraten.de/640/image/upload/v1793028647/Impressions%20and%20Other%20Assets/715a718c3a468168ebd6f2484fc70ac45ca3619037bea6c4fb7caade63c3_ytlnij.jpg" length="54279" type="image/jpeg"></enclosure></item><item><title>Family 5⭐️ Sri Lanka getaway with breakfast, flights &amp; luggage 🇱🇰</title><link>https://www.holidaypirates.com/packages/the-eden-beruwala-sri-lanka-family</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.holidaypirates.com/packages/the-eden-beruwala-sri-lanka-family</guid><pubDate>Tue, 03 Nov 2026 14:49:00 +0000</pubDate><description>Ahoy Pirates! Treat the crew to bucket-list luxury in Sri Lanka with breakfast, flights and luggage.Your base is the stunning beachfront 5⭐️ The Eden Beruwala, an effortless all-inclusive paradise designed to keep the entire family entertained and completely relaxed.Days are made for splashing in the sprawling palm-fringed swimming pools, building sandcastles on the beach, or heading out to spot local marine life. Best of all, return flights with Qatar come with a generous 25kg luggage allowance per person—plenty of room for buckets, spades, and holiday souvenirs!You may need to scroll down to see the cheapest flights options.</description><enclosure url="https://image.urlaubspiraten.de/640/image/upload/v1793795723/Impressions%20and%20Other%20Assets/g7obvtuoni2rek6a9abw.jpg" length="56465" type="image/jpeg"></enclosure></item><item><title>Last-minute Amsterdam Christmas market mini-break ✈️🇳🇱🎅</title><link>https://www.holidaypirates.com/packages/xo-hotels-blue-square-amsterdam</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.holidaypirates.com/packages/xo-hotels-blue-square-amsterdam</guid><pubDate>Tue, 03 Nov 2026 14:14:05 +0000</pubDate><description>Pirates! Who fancies a last-minute mini-break to Amsterdam for an absolute bargain? 😲🎄This two-night trip pairs a stay at the Xo Hotels Blue Square with flights from London, so you can focus on the important stuff, like which Xmas market stall you'll visit first.Price breakdown👇</description><enclosure url="https://image.urlaubspiraten.de/640/image/upload/v1702289936/mediavault_images/shutterstock_2278308299_bz9dc2.jpg" length="68829" type="image/jpeg"></enclosure></item><item><title>Stunning 4⭐️ all-inclusive Corfu holiday 🌴🍹</title><link>https://www.holidaypirates.com/packages/canvas-by-mitsis-messonghi-corfu-greece</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.holidaypirates.com/packages/canvas-by-mitsis-messonghi-corfu-greece</guid><pubDate>Tue, 03 Nov 2026 13:29:30 +0000</pubDate><description>Mateys, head to Corfu with this all-inclusive getaway we have come across with On the Beach. You will stay in the 4⭐️ Canvas by Mitsis Messonghi, which has become part of the Mitsis collection. It feels like a boutique hotel but with all the facilities of a big resort.Located right on the beach, perfect for a lazy swim, but the hotel also has some stunning new pool areas if you'd rather lounge with a cocktail in hand. 🍸Messonghi is a lovely, traditional village area. You can wander out of the hotel gates and find local tavernas and little shops within two minutes.Price breakdown👇Resort fees are paid directly to the hotel when you arrive, not to On the Beach. We’re honest pirates, so we like to be upfront about exactly what your holiday will cost.</description><enclosure url="https://image.urlaubspiraten.de/640/image/upload/v1774002152/Impressions%20and%20Other%20Assets/1_kbwmt2.jpg" length="52051" type="image/jpeg"></enclosure></item><item><title>PRICE DROP: 4⭐️ all-inclusive Montenegro holiday 🌴☀️🐚</title><link>https://www.holidaypirates.com/packages/iberostar-waves-herceg-novi-herceg-novi-montenegro</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.holidaypirates.com/packages/iberostar-waves-herceg-novi-herceg-novi-montenegro</guid><pubDate>Tue, 03 Nov 2026 12:47:51 +0000</pubDate><description>Mateys, check out this lush getaway to Montenegro we have come across, staying for 4 nights in an absolutely stunning hotel.You’ll stay at the 4⭐️ Iberostar Waves Herceg Novi, near the beach on the Bay of Kotor, with stunning views. The all-inclusive board basis means snacks, meals and drinks are included. Woo!Head off from £349 £320 in April -- other dates in the same month can cost over £400, so well worth aiming for our highlighted date. </description><enclosure url="https://image.urlaubspiraten.de/640/image/upload/v1695323313/Impressions%20and%20Other%20Assets/iberostar-herceg-novi-0_fdoe6t.jpg" length="51376" type="image/jpeg"></enclosure></item><item><title>4-night Algarve getaway with flights for a steal  🤯🌴✈️</title><link>https://www.holidaypirates.com/packages/studio-17-by-atlantic-hotels-portimao-algarve-portugal</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.holidaypirates.com/packages/studio-17-by-atlantic-hotels-portimao-algarve-portugal</guid><pubDate>Tue, 03 Nov 2026 12:37:01 +0000</pubDate><description>Pirates, pack your bags! We’ve found a fantastic 4-night getaway to Portimão on Portugal's stunning Algarve coast staying at Studio 17 by Atlantic Hotels.You'll stay in a fully equipped self-catering studio featuring a kitchenette, satellite TV, free WiFi, and access to a lovely outdoor swimming pool and sun terrace.It’s perfectly located close to major local supermarkets, a short stroll from Portimão city centre, and not too far from the beach and bars of Praia da Rocha! 🏖️🍹Price breakdown👇Resort fees are paid directly to the hotel when you arrive, not to On the Beach. We’re honest pirates, so we like to be upfront about exactly what your holiday will cost.</description><enclosure url="https://image.urlaubspiraten.de/640/image/upload/v1603285185/mediavault_images/yje9hcxs16gnnpndoweu.jpg" length="55416" type="image/jpeg"></enclosure></item><item><title>Bargain Poznań break with flights &amp; stay in the Old Town UNDER £70 🇵🇱</title><link>https://www.holidaypirates.com/packages/hotel-traffic-poznan-stare-miasto-poznan-poland</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.holidaypirates.com/packages/hotel-traffic-poznan-stare-miasto-poznan-poland</guid><pubDate>Tue, 03 Nov 2026 12:20:00 +0000</pubDate><description>Poznań is one of those cities that rarely tops the list but always wins people over once they're there -- pastel townhouses, a goat-clock town hall, and streets built for wandering with a coffee in hand.With flights from London included and a two-night stay at the central Hotel Traffic Poznań Stare Miasto, this last-minute getaway is built for a quick dose of Polish charm without overthinking it.Pack light, leave soon, and let the Old Town do the rest.Price breakdown👇</description><enclosure url="https://image.urlaubspiraten.de/640/image/upload/v1637234891/mediavault_images/AdobeStock_66585358_gg4a7t.jpg" length="69012" type="image/jpeg"></enclosure></item><item><title>Family 4⭐ Malta holiday with flights and heated rooftop pool 💦🇲🇹</title><link>https://www.holidaypirates.com/packages/innside-by-melia-bugibba-malta-family</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.holidaypirates.com/packages/innside-by-melia-bugibba-malta-family</guid><pubDate>Tue, 03 Nov 2026 12:05:00 +0000</pubDate><description>Ahoy Pirates! Treat the crew to a sun-soaked Malta getaway at a top 4-star base! Whisk the family away to coastal Bugibba with a seamless package bundling return flights and accommodation. The stylish 4⭐️ INNSiDE by Melia Bugibba makes holidaying with the kids effortless, boasting a showstopping heated rooftop infinity pool where the family can swim no matter the season. While the kids splash with panoramic island views, parents can take turns grabbing a refreshing drink from the sky bar right above.  Price breakdown👇Resort fees are paid directly to the hotel when you arrive, not to On the Beach. We’re honest pirates, so we like to be upfront about exactly what your holiday will cost.</description><enclosure url="https://image.urlaubspiraten.de/640/image/upload/v1603285752/mediavault_images/zwy6jsua8xvxysp6a8ft.jpg" length="109968" type="image/jpeg"></enclosure></item><item><title>Now even cheaper 👉 All-inclusive Turkey family spring week for a CRAZY price 🤯</title><link>https://www.holidaypirates.com/packages/all-inclusive-turkey-family-week-catty-cats-garden-hotel</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.holidaypirates.com/packages/all-inclusive-turkey-family-week-catty-cats-garden-hotel</guid><pubDate>Tue, 03 Nov 2026 12:03:00 +0000</pubDate><description>Pirates, check out this package we found with On the Beach: an all-inclusive week for a family in Turkey heading off in April from £182 per person! Absolute bargain!You'll get direct flights and a 7-night stay at the 3⭐️ Catty Cats Garden Hotel in Side. The hotel has a 4/5 rating on Tripadvisor and comes with a pool and slides!</description><enclosure url="https://image.urlaubspiraten.de/640/image/upload/v1769708433/Impressions%20and%20Other%20Assets/Hotel-Catty-Cats-Garden-General_xet0ro.jpg" length="68364" type="image/jpeg"></enclosure></item><item><title>Last-minute Tunisia week at 5⭐ all-inclusive resort 💦🇹🇳</title><link>https://www.holidaypirates.com/packages/tour-khalef-tunisia</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.holidaypirates.com/packages/tour-khalef-tunisia</guid><pubDate>Tue, 03 Nov 2026 11:58:02 +0000</pubDate><description>The Tour Khalef has racked up a 4.5/5 score on Tripadvisor from more than 5,700 reviews, which is the kind of consensus that is hard to argue with.Add a genuine 5-star all-inclusive set-up in Tunisia and a week here, departing within the month, looks like the easiest booking you will make all year.Think sunloungers, a steady stream of food and drink, and zero spreadsheet-juggling once you land.Price breakdown👇Resort fees are paid directly to the hotel when you arrive, not to Loveholidays. We’re honest pirates, so we like to be upfront about exactly what your holiday will cost.</description><enclosure url="https://image.urlaubspiraten.de/640/image/upload/v1793706925/Impressions%20and%20Other%20Assets/yicik0sy4lnxeofjdklf.jpg" length="46308" type="image/jpeg"></enclosure></item><item><title>5⭐ Dominican Republic ALL-INC week at NEW resort with SWIM-UP room 💦</title><link>https://www.holidaypirates.com/packages/serenade-caribe-club-family-beach-resort-punta-cana</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.holidaypirates.com/packages/serenade-caribe-club-family-beach-resort-punta-cana</guid><pubDate>Tue, 03 Nov 2026 11:52:00 +0000</pubDate><description>This is a brand-new 5-star hotel in Punta Cana with direct flights and a full week of all-inclusive bundled together, and a swim-up room to boot, from £1,079. Adding the swim-up room only cost an extar £80, so honestly, it would be rude not to!Picture gliding straight from your room into the pool before breakfast, with the Caribbean sun doing all the work.Everything here still has that fresh, just-opened sheen, from the rooms to the restaurants, so you will be among the first to enjoy it.Seven nights of easy, all-inclusive living in one of the Dominican Republic's most loved beach destinations.</description><enclosure url="https://image.urlaubspiraten.de/640/image/upload/v1784826073/Impressions%20and%20Other%20Assets/86a58ea45e497fd538957c1076e546fa7a8fecbc_ftya3r.avif" length="27368" type="image/jpeg"></enclosure></item><item><title>5⭐ Dominican Republican all-inc family week with swim-up room 💦🇩🇴</title><link>https://www.holidaypirates.com/packages/serenade-caribe-club-family-beach-resort-punta-cana-family</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.holidaypirates.com/packages/serenade-caribe-club-family-beach-resort-punta-cana-family</guid><pubDate>Tue, 03 Nov 2026 11:52:00 +0000</pubDate><description>This is a brand-new 5-star hotel in Punta Cana with direct flights and a full week of all-inclusive bundled together, and a swim-up room to boot, from £919. Adding the swim-up room only cost an extar £60, so honestly, it would be rude not to!Picture gliding straight from your room into the pool before breakfast, with the Caribbean sun doing all the work.Everything here still has that fresh, just-opened sheen, from the rooms to the restaurants, so you will be among the first to enjoy it.Seven nights of easy, all-inclusive living in one of the Dominican Republic's most loved beach destinations.</description><enclosure url="https://image.urlaubspiraten.de/640/image/upload/v1793351238/Impressions%20and%20Other%20Assets/aijdyulsjae4p9nev5ns.jpg" length="53996" type="image/jpeg"></enclosure></item><item><title>New 4⭐️ Lanzarote villa holiday with private pool 🥰🌴🍹</title><link>https://www.holidaypirates.com/packages/serena-del-mar-by-livvo-lanzarote</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.holidaypirates.com/packages/serena-del-mar-by-livvo-lanzarote</guid><pubDate>Tue, 03 Nov 2026 11:51:00 +0000</pubDate><description>Lanzarote does volcanic drama better than almost anywhere -- lunar landscapes, lava-rock vineyards, and coastline that looks like nowhere else in Europe.Serena Del Mar By LIVVO, brand-new in 2025, gives you a private villa with its own pool to retreat to after a day of exploring, plus a shared infinity pool if you want to mingle.Self-catering means cooking up whatever you fancy, and with space for up to four, it suits couples or small groups equally well. Flights and transfers are included.Pricing👇</description><enclosure url="https://image.urlaubspiraten.de/640/image/upload/v1793635046/Impressions%20and%20Other%20Assets/1_lzrfey.jpg" length="53543" type="image/jpeg"></enclosure></item><item><title>Majorca: a family week at lush 4⭐ beachfront resort 🌞🏝️🇪🇸 </title><link>https://www.holidaypirates.com/packages/zafiro-bahia-platja-de-muro-majorca-spain-march</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.holidaypirates.com/packages/zafiro-bahia-platja-de-muro-majorca-spain-march</guid><pubDate>Tue, 03 Nov 2026 11:50:55 +0000</pubDate><description>Pirates, check out this 7-night Majorca family getaway, with flights and a lush stay at the 4-star Zafiro Bahía right on Platja de Muro from £333 per person when travelling as two adults and two kids. The beachfront aparthotel is a beautiful Mediterranean-style holiday village on the northern Coast of Majorca. There are six pools, a beautiful spa with adult-only spaces, and a kids' splash pool with a pirate ship. It's a great resort for couples as well as families, as there are a lot of activities and entertainment to keep the little ones busy. If you booked the same trip with another travel provider, you'd pay over £200 more per person (so that's a total saving of £800 when travelling as a family of four), so this is a great price. You can secure this price with a deposit just shy of €660 (about £551), so you don't have to pay everything upfront. This deal departs from Manchester, but you can also choose to fly from London for a smidge more.  </description><enclosure url="https://image.urlaubspiraten.de/640/image/upload/v1693835339/mediavault_images/shutterstock_2151559107_q54bvi.jpg" length="77665" type="image/jpeg"></enclosure></item><item><title>10-night Tokyo holiday with flights and central 3⭐ hotel</title><link>https://www.holidaypirates.com/packages/hotel-tavinos-hamamatsucho-tokyo</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.holidaypirates.com/packages/hotel-tavinos-hamamatsucho-tokyo</guid><pubDate>Tue, 03 Nov 2026 11:43:09 +0000</pubDate><description>TEN nights, one central Tokyo base, £889 -- that's a steal considering you'll get flights, luggage and your stay included.HOTEL TAVINOS Hamamatsucho sits in Minato-ku, putting you within easy reach of Tokyo Tower, the bay and the city's rail network, so you're never far from wherever you fancy exploring next.Worth knowing up front: rooms here are snug, in true Japanese city-hotel style, so this suits travellers who want a comfortable crash pad rather than a sprawling suite.You can take January Tokyo at your own pace -- warm bowls of ramen after cold, clear days, temple visits without the rush, and plenty of time to wander neighbourhoods most visitors never reach.</description><enclosure url="https://image.urlaubspiraten.de/640/image/upload/v1603293084/mediavault_images/q1qzsutrqibhmc5cj4i7.jpg" length="143463" type="image/jpeg"></enclosure></item><item><title>9-night Crete holiday at award-winning hotel plus flights 🌴🌞🇬🇷</title><link>https://www.holidaypirates.com/packages/rainbow-apartments-stalida-crete</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.holidaypirates.com/packages/rainbow-apartments-stalida-crete</guid><pubDate>Tue, 03 Nov 2026 11:37:15 +0000</pubDate><description>Crete can be a good choice for a long, lazy holiday, and this 9-night stint in Stalida gives you plenty of time to settle into island life properly.Rainbow Apartments is a highly rated, award-winning 3-star spot, and handily, a 9-night trip here actually costs less than a shorter 6-night trip -- so there is no reason to rush home.Expect sun-warmed afternoons, easy tavernas nearby and the kind of unhurried pace that makes you forget your return flight exists.Pricing👇</description><enclosure url="https://image.urlaubspiraten.de/640/image/upload/v1793705565/Impressions%20and%20Other%20Assets/4_comvfr.jpg" length="46350" type="image/jpeg"></enclosure></item><item><title>3-night cruise around the Bahamas - depart from Miami 🌊🏝️</title><link>https://www.holidaypirates.com/cruises/bahamas-msc-seaside-cruise</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.holidaypirates.com/cruises/bahamas-msc-seaside-cruise</guid><pubDate>Tue, 03 Nov 2026 10:44:01 +0000</pubDate><description>Three nights, one ship, endless horizon -- that's the deal on this cruise around the Bahamas.MSC Seaside is one of the big, glossy ships built for lounging by the pool as much as exploring new shores, so expect sea days that feel like a holiday in themselves.From £130, you get a short but proper escape from routine, with turquoise water practically guaranteed and island stops to stretch your legs.It's a neat way to tick off the Bahamas without committing to a week away.</description><enclosure url="https://image.urlaubspiraten.de/640/image/upload/v1697211913/Impressions%20and%20Other%20Assets/MSC17013354_oec06d.jpg" length="55348" type="image/jpeg"></enclosure></item><item><title>10-night no-frills Morocco holiday with flights &amp; stay in the old medina 🇲🇦</title><link>https://www.holidaypirates.com/packages/hotel-mauritania-centre-tangier</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.holidaypirates.com/packages/hotel-mauritania-centre-tangier</guid><pubDate>Tue, 03 Nov 2026 09:48:31 +0000</pubDate><description>Ten nights abroad for less than £200 sounds like a typo, but it is exactly what this Tangier holiday offers.Tucked into the Old Medina near Dar Borj Lbaroud and Souk Barra, the hotel keeps things cheap and cheerful -- basic, by its own admission, but excellent value for what you pay.Wander the medina's winding lanes, haggle in the souks, then head five minutes downhill to the sea front and beach, where winter sun keeps things mild at 15-17°C.</description><enclosure url="https://image.urlaubspiraten.de/640/image/upload/v1668426582/mediavault_images/shutterstock_1414181243_gakz8o.jpg" length="76310" type="image/jpeg"></enclosure></item><item><title>Winter sun: 4⭐ Tenerife week with flights and brekkie 🌞🇪🇸</title><link>https://www.holidaypirates.com/packages/o7-tenerife-puerto-de-la-cruz</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.holidaypirates.com/packages/o7-tenerife-puerto-de-la-cruz</guid><pubDate>Tue, 03 Nov 2026 09:48:06 +0000</pubDate><description>Forget pricey last-minute flight searches -- this Tenerife deal with Sundeals bundles your flights, seven nights, and breakfast into one simple package from £302, so you can get some winter sun without breaking the bank.While some hotels leave you guessing, O7 Tenerife has a solid 4.2/5 Tripadvisor rating behind it, so you know what you're getting.Base yourself in Puerto de la Cruz, with its volcanic coastline and laid-back promenade cafes, and let the week unfold at its own easy pace. Fly from Liverpool for the best price, but there are lots of departure airports and departure dates available for great prices. Sundeals is a low-cost travel brand that was launched by TUI in July 2026 to target budget- and value-conscious travellers in the UK. </description><enclosure url="https://image.urlaubspiraten.de/640/image/upload/v1774876224/Impressions%20and%20Other%20Assets/69868692_oxmzpn.jpg" length="61585" type="image/jpeg"></enclosure></item><item><title>4⭐ Malta break with rooftop pool, spa and flights 💦🇲🇹</title><link>https://www.holidaypirates.com/packages/hotel-maritim-antonine-spa-mellieha-malta</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.holidaypirates.com/packages/hotel-maritim-antonine-spa-mellieha-malta</guid><pubDate>Tue, 03 Nov 2026 09:45:43 +0000</pubDate><description>Four nights, flights included, and a 4⭐ hotel with not one but three pools (rooftop, indoor, and outdoor) -- plus a full-service spa for whenever you fancy switching off completely.Malta's mild winter climate and honey-coloured limestone villages make Mellieha a gentle, good-value base for some winter sun, and with departure airports widely available, getting there is the easy part.The hard part is deciding which pool to start with. You can extend your stay to a week from £241 or go with kids if you want to make it a family affair. This deal is completely customisable, so you can change the number of guests, departure airport, departure date, duration etc. to suit you. </description><enclosure url="https://image.urlaubspiraten.de/640/image/upload/v1793633771/Impressions%20and%20Other%20Assets/Screenshot_2026-10-30_at_15.35.11_se88fm.png" length="302370" type="image/jpeg"></enclosure></item><item><title>Stay at Sweden's famous Ice Hotel 🧊❄️</title><link>https://www.holidaypirates.com/hotels/ice-hotel-jukkasjarvi-sweden</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.holidaypirates.com/hotels/ice-hotel-jukkasjarvi-sweden</guid><pubDate>Tue, 03 Nov 2026 08:57:56 +0000</pubDate><description>Here's a bold claim: nowhere else on earth will you sleep somewhere quite like this.The Ice Hotel Jukkasjärvi is rebuilt from scratch every year out of ice and snow, its walls carved by artists into something closer to a sculpture gallery than a place to rest your head.This last-minute one-night stay drops you into the Swedish Arctic, with thermal sleeping bags and reindeer skins standing between you and the sub-zero chill.From £187 a night, it's one of those once-in-a-lifetime nights you'll be talking about for years -- think crackling northern silence, maybe even the northern lights overhead, and a story that beats any souvenir.</description><enclosure url="https://image.urlaubspiraten.de/640/image/upload/v1782887167/Impressions%20and%20Other%20Assets/429002761_ydafbd.jpg" length="34872" type="image/jpeg"></enclosure></item><item><title>Krakow break with Gorący Potok therme spa entry for a STEAL 🫧🇵🇱</title><link>https://www.holidaypirates.com/packages/hotel-nowa-panorama-krakow</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.holidaypirates.com/packages/hotel-nowa-panorama-krakow</guid><pubDate>Tue, 03 Nov 2026 08:33:22 +0000</pubDate><description>Pirates, word on the street is that the best way to beat the January blues is to have a holiday booked! And what better place to visit than Krakow for a weekend? 🇵🇱We've spotted a lush 2-night break where you don't even have to book any annual leave. It includes a central stay, flights and entry to the Gorący Potok Thermal Baths, which are just over an hour away from Krakow's city centre by public transport.Price breakdown👇</description><enclosure url="https://image.urlaubspiraten.de/640/image/upload/v1793694721/Impressions%20and%20Other%20Assets/e113addd37d8c87246e010d2b9b0bb134c319da4542c412573a3bc6429213acf_b3d3cy.avif" length="97236" type="image/jpeg"></enclosure></item><item><title>Last-second 5-night Lapland family trip for an unbelievable price 🦌❄️</title><link>https://www.holidaypirates.com/packages/motelli-rovaniemi-lapland-finland</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.holidaypirates.com/packages/motelli-rovaniemi-lapland-finland</guid><pubDate>Tue, 03 Nov 2026 06:24:34 +0000</pubDate><description>Picture the scene: You tell the little ones with barely a week's notice that you're taking them on a magical break to Lapland because HolidayPirates found a deal too good to pass up. Rovaniemi is the official home to Santa, with so many fun family activities. 😍To get this price, you'll book return flights from Manchester and 5 nights at Motelli Rovaniemi, and you'll depart next week. What's the catch? Well, it's early season, and snow certainly isn't guaranteed, but I did check the forecast and there are snow showers showing for next week, so that's a good sign! Santa Claus' Village is magical either way, and you'll save a fair chunk from peak season. You might even see reindeer casually roaming the hotel grounds.Price breakdown👇</description><enclosure url="https://image.urlaubspiraten.de/640/image/upload/v1720695999/Impressions%20and%20Other%20Assets/shutterstock_1548297680_l6phit.jpg" length="38094" type="image/jpeg"></enclosure></item><item><title>ITALY: Festive Venice date night with flights and hotel included 🇮🇹💕</title><link>https://www.holidaypirates.com/packages/locanda-casa-martini-venice</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.holidaypirates.com/packages/locanda-casa-martini-venice</guid><pubDate>Tue, 03 Nov 2026 06:05:34 +0000</pubDate><description>Fancy swapping a Tuesday night in front of the telly for candlelit canals instead?This last-minute trip to Venice gets you there with flights sorted and a night at the Locanda Casa Martini, a cosy bed and breakfast tucked into the city's maze of waterways.For a romantic night away, Venice barely needs to try. Think: gondolas, fresh pasta in cosy trattorias, wine by the canal and bridges made for stopping to kiss on.Price breakdown👇</description><enclosure url="https://image.urlaubspiraten.de/640/image/upload/v1666777068/Impressions%20and%20Other%20Assets/shutterstock_2097733714_udpfw3.jpg" length="39826" type="image/jpeg"></enclosure></item></channel></rss>